{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19222","headline":"詶国子崔博士立之见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶国子崔博士立之见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"健笔高科早绝伦，後来无不揖芳尘。\n遍看今日乘轩客，多是昔年呈卷人。\n胄子执经瞻讲坐，郎官共食接华茵。\n烦君远寄相思曲，慰问天南一逐臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}